# The Reach Remembers — repeatable cache recoveries (a19, showrunner 2026-08-04: replaced the
# one-shot Boundary Stones). Warden Ossa marks a buried Reach cache at ONE of 10 region-scanned
# sand sites S/W of town (all three cluster columns verified pure surface sand); the player brushes
# the suspicious sand, recovers the deed token, and turns it in — repeatable forever, fixed payout.
# #cache_site ci_cache = the active site index (0 = none); per-player ci_cache score = lifetime
# recoveries (telemetry). Site table lives in storage (macro-driven arm/place/clean/shine — one
# function each instead of 4 x 10 generated files).
scoreboard objectives add ci_cache dummy
execute unless score #cache_site ci_cache matches 0.. run scoreboard players set #cache_site ci_cache 0
execute unless score #cache_t ci_cache matches 0.. run scoreboard players set #cache_t ci_cache 0
